Read-out guide: ratios consistently >= ~1.5 per cluster -> cluster-scale inversion is worth attempting; ~1.0-1.3 -> treat Pune+PCMC as one source. Inspect the exported map as well: the enhancement should sit on PCMC, not only on central Pune.
